<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-10-19T00:17:41.393Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:17:41 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Fitgharan forces still control the Mogadishu-Baidoa corridor while Laftagareen forces have taken Buurhakaba and a third town in the Bay region, intensifying local fighting. Al Shabaab detonated an IED in Mandera, injuring six civilians, and humanitarian groups in Somalia are operating with reduced aid budgets. Ethiopia announced plans to withdraw more than 3,000 troops from Somalia as its own conflict escalates, and Somaliland and Puntland were designated as &amp;quot;friendly&amp;quot; in an Israeli security framework. Somalia is screening travelers after Kenya confirmed an imported Ebola case and has agreed to acquire Pakistani JF‑17 fighter jets. The ICRC reported 148 wounded treated after heavy fighting in Baidoa, and there were 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOR0cxVVRVejVZYUxfelFDWnhNdUc2Q2ZWbnN3VlR6eURScktsLUxkcVh0RllENUw1a0ZvdU45MkJuZVk1THNxMkt0M1FoOUFKSF9mNGZjYXBnTnRfN1MweGsyRncxUW1wYnJtNDBWdVJtVTc3S0ZFNEhXOFJGYXdCbmdlcnVSN09NSk5sQVZ6czUzMURxWEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPd0M3YXl5TjZfNFlSQXVkS25jeTJvWjRnMzhHRWZGaGV5YktXTkxQVUdDYjFNQnZmLU5JLWxGaENSRzBUcXpOWVRzVmVOSmtEZ0p2eXdNdEt3UzUwV0puRnNpWnRlSmg3OHUzNjEtVm1kMTFpeVlMQ3dhSlJrOUJwc2d3UDhKY01OcWlUQnhnZ1c5a0dtODdGZ1o4VXVSeWlnV2V5c2Nmcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;FTL Somalia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOVXRJWk5YWmNUZ2F4OHEzaFNXZWl3QWU2WnJ1bDlxXzdTMnNGaWFnTFBWOWlZRDA5U2pFdGN3MXU1X2o5TzJDQXJqR2libUlFSGpkWjBIVFJtbkV6czJZWXhpbWlZamREWl9TM0ZSUGtlSVpvb1FsS3ZrR2xkcWxCZ2pRcGM3ZDFzYldkUDFpa3p3Z2JOZ1pBT2liV3NnZnZ3NTZzcEFPaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPcVhta2w4UlRHaEVsQXp